msgstr "Only Markdown text files and .zip files are supported."

msgid "从内容列表中单独或批量导出 Markdown ZIP。媒体库图片会写入 images 目录，并在 Markdown 中使用相对路径。"
msgstr "Export Markdown ZIP files individually or in bulk from content lists. Media Library images are written to the images directory and referenced with relative paths."

msgid "以下 Markdown 解析组件缺失，对应选项暂不可用：%s。请重新安装本插件。"
msgstr "The following Markdown parser components are missing, so their options are unavailable: %s. Please reinstall this plugin."

