msgstr "The remote image was added to the Media Library, but its URL could not be retrieved."

msgid "远程图片格式未在导入设置中启用。"
msgstr "The remote image format is not enabled in Import Settings."

msgid "远程图片超过 %s 限制。"
msgstr "The remote image exceeds the %s limit."

msgid "远程文件不是受支持的图片格式。"
msgstr "The remote file is not a supported image format."

